meta {
  name: Create Sample Tiered Pricing
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/?alondra-webhook=create_sample_tiered_pricing
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Inserts one "Sample Tiered Pricing" group (status publish, priority 1) with two rules and
  two fixed-amount tiers (1-10 units @ 50.0, 11+ units @ 60.0), then flushes the cache.

  No params, but it resolves demo-catalog fixtures by SKU/slug/login and throws a 500 naming
  whatever is missing if the store was never seeded (bin/setup / seed_demo_store):
  SKUs CDL-KG and CSC-KG, product_tag "single-origin", product_cat "equipment"/"grinders",
  and the "admin" user login.
}
